47
00:01:16,312 --> 00:01:18,520
And rescheduling them if necessary.

48
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:18,794
Julie:

49
00:01:18,794 --> 00:01:19,068
Fine,

50
00:01:19,068 --> 00:01:20,710
