73
00:02:20,810 --> 00:02:21,098
Greg:

74
00:02:21,098 --> 00:02:22,540
I’m sure you can.

75
00:02:22,540 --> 00:02:22,959
Greg:

76
00:02:22,959 --> 00:02:29,242
And then another thing they mention is that they’re looking for someone with good

77
00:02:29,242 --> 00:02:30,080
IT skills …

78
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,412
Julie:

79
00:02:30,412 --> 00:02:31,410
Not a problem.

80
00:02:31,410 --> 00:02:31,700
Greg:

81
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:34,310
