82
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:34,747
Julie:

83
00:02:34,747 --> 00:02:35,183
Sure.

84
00:02:35,183 --> 00:02:36,930
When would it start?

85
00:02:36,930 --> 00:02:37,281
Greg:

86
00:02:37,281 --> 00:02:41,495
Well, they’re looking for someone from the beginning of next month,

87
00:02:41,495 --> 00:02:46,412
but I should tell you that this isn’t a permanent job, it’s

88
00:02:46,412 --> 00:02:46,763
