90
00:02:50,626 --> 00:02:54,840
But they do say that there could be further opportunities after that.

91
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,221
Julie:

92
00:02:55,221 --> 00:02:55,602
OK.

93
00:02:55,602 --> 00:02:57,890
And what would the hours be?

94
00:02:57,890 --> 00:02:58,185
Greg:

95
00:02:58,185 --> 00:03:02,315
Well, they want someone who can start at a quarter to eight in the

96
00:03:02,315 --> 00:03:03,790
