102
00:03:13,650 --> 00:03:14,080
Greg:

103
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,940
One fifteen.

104
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:15,242
Julie:

105
00:03:15,242 --> 00:03:17,057
That should work out all right.

106
00:03:17,057 --> 00:03:20,080
I can pick the kids up on my way home,

107
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:22,802
