108
00:03:22,802 --> 00:03:26,430
Oh, one thing … is there parking available for staff at the centre?

109
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:26,737
Greg:

110
00:03:26,737 --> 00:03:27,657
Yes, there is,

111
00:03:27,657 --> 00:03:30,110
